{"t":"Parchment Room Quest","s":"parchment-room-quest-34d68","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/P_way_8013ff.jpg","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Parchment Room Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"timealloc\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Est. Length</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10 minutes</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(120 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.2<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 16, 2003<br/>Christmas Update 2003</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>Someone has set up a dangerous trap to protect an important key.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Hero%20Cave\">Hero Cave</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p>5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon\">Demons</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hero\">Heroes</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Priestess\">Priestesses</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Monk%20%28Creature%29\">Monks</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Skeleton\">Demon Skeletons</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bonelord\">Bonelords</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hunter\">Hunters</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Wild%20Warrior\">Wild Warriors</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Magician\">Dark Magicians</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Apprentice\">Dark Apprentices</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Bag\">Brown Bag</a> containing <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%206010\">Key 6010</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bone\">Bone</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Stealth%20Ring\">Stealth Ring</a>, 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Talon\">Talons</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Skull%20%28Item%29\">Skull</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Required_equipment\">Required equipment</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pick\">Pick</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">Rope</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Getting_there\">Getting there</span></h2>\n<ul><li>First you have to enter the <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Hero%20Cave\">Hero Cave</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33164,31638,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33164, 31638, 7)</a>).</li>\n<li>Then follow the way described on the picture below.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"P way\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"106\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/P_way_8013ff.jpg\" width=\"575\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Use a pick to open the hole.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"P hole\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"318\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/P_hole_320afb.jpg\" width=\"419\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Now go down and head to the west. Here you will find a single gravestone and a teleporter to a big room with one <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon\">Demon</a> inside, the Parchment Room. The text on the gravestone says:</li></ul>\n<pre>De.th to those who disturb ..e slumber of .ath..\n</pre>\n<p>This reads as:<br/>\n</p>\n<pre>Death to those who disturb the slumber of Father\n</pre>\n<p>Get prepared to face the demon and enter the teleporter.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-The_Quest_Room\">The Quest Room</span></h2>\n<ul><li>After you have killed the <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon\">Demon</a>, go to the coffin in the middle of the room.</li>\n<li>When you push the <a href=\"#/wiki/Parchment%20%28Yellow%29\">Yellow Parchment</a> (<a href=\"#/wiki/Buried%20Forever%20%28Book%29\">Buried Forever</a>) 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon\">Demons</a> will spawn around you.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"P room\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"437\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/P_room_06d4b1.gif\" width=\"538\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Now you can decide to kill the demons or to grab the reward and run away. You have to open the coffin to get the reward.</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["demon-helmet-quest"]}